Z||000006||Uaana||05-16-2000||01:11 AM||||Great! Just Great...<BR>Now that I took apart the missus Kirby and installed it into the aircleaner housing. didnt take that much work and with the ac/dc converter from radio shack didn't cost much either. <BR>Anyone know a vacume cleaner repairman??? help before she gets back from visiting her parents..||||reg||8
Z||000007||Fiasco||05-16-2000||02:15 AM||||I knew a guy who took the smog pump on his '73 MGB and turned it around and routed it into the carbs for a micro-supercharger of sorts. He swore up and down he could feel the difference... of course I never got to try it out and he never had it dynoed, so there ya go.<BR>But then again... my stock '71 MGB has so little power that I don't doubt I would notice a 0.001 lb boost!!||||reg||3
